{"type":"data","nodes":[{"type":"data","data":[{"i18n":1},{"translations":2,"records":88,"locale":93,"route":94,"preferred":95},{"cs":3,"en":48},{"site.tagline":4,"nav.home":5,"nav.docs":6,"nav.examples":7,"nav.playground":8,"nav.github":9,"nav.npm":10,"nav.language":11,"lang.en":12,"lang.cs":13,"lang.de":14,"banner.v3":15,"error.title":16,"error.404":17,"error.default":18,"error.home":19,"home":20},"Internacionalizace pro SvelteKit","Domů","Dokumentace","Příklady","Hřiště","GitHub","npm","Jazyk","English","Čeština","Deutsch","Toto je dokumentace k v3. Pro řadu v2 se podívej na větev {{branch}}.","Něco se pokazilo","Tato stránka neexistuje.","Došlo k neočekávané chybě.","Zpět na úvodní stránku",{"read":21,"requirements":22,"why":23,"start":24,"more":25,"step":26,"feature":29},"Přečíst dokumentaci","Svelte 5 a Node 22, Bun 1.2 nebo Deno 2 a novější. Pouze ESM.","Proč sveltekit-i18n","Rychlý start","Kompletní průvodce prvními kroky",{"config":27,"use":28},"Popiš překlady, které aplikace načítá, a napoj je na SvelteKit.","Čti je z instance. Text se řídí aktivním jazykem.",{"sveltekit":30,"install":33,"lazy":36,"runes":39,"types":42,"extensions":45},{"title":31,"text":32},"Stavěné pro SvelteKit","sveltekit-i18n/kit propojí hooky, layouty i komponenty: na serveru instance na každý požadavek, takže jazyk jednoho návštěvníka nikdy nedorazí na stránku druhého, v prohlížeči jedna na kartu.",{"title":34,"text":35},"Jedna instalace","Jádro i parser Curly jsou součástí. Nic dalšího se nepřidává a reaktivní graf zůstává jeden.",{"title":37,"text":38},"Načítá, co route potřebuje","Loader se spustí, když sedí jeho jazyk i route — jednou za období platnosti a parametry route.",{"title":40,"text":41},"Jedna reaktivní instance","Svelte 5 runes místo stores: vlastnosti se čtou, metody se awaitují.",{"title":43,"text":44},"Typované klíče i parametry","Slot schema zúží, co t() a l() přijmou — až na parametry jednotlivých zpráv. Vite plugin @sveltekit-i18n/typegen ho vyplní z tvých překladů.",{"title":46,"text":47},"Rozšiřitelné","Pipe extensions přidává instanci další povrchy — třeba Svelte stores.",{"site.tagline":49,"nav.home":50,"nav.docs":51,"nav.examples":52,"nav.playground":53,"nav.github":9,"nav.npm":10,"nav.language":54,"lang.en":12,"lang.cs":13,"lang.de":14,"banner.v3":55,"error.title":56,"error.404":57,"error.default":58,"error.home":59,"home":60},"Internationalization for SvelteKit","Home","Documentation","Examples","Playground","Language","This is the documentation for v3. For the v2 line, see the {{branch}} branch.","Something went wrong","This page does not exist.","An unexpected error occurred.","Back to the homepage",{"read":61,"requirements":62,"why":63,"start":64,"more":65,"step":66,"feature":69},"Read the documentation","Svelte 5 and Node 22, Bun 1.2 or Deno 2 or newer. ESM only.","Why sveltekit-i18n","Quick start","The full getting started guide",{"config":67,"use":68},"Describe the translations your app loads, and wire them into SvelteKit.","Read them off the instance. The text follows the active locale.",{"sveltekit":70,"install":73,"lazy":76,"runes":79,"types":82,"extensions":85},{"title":71,"text":72},"Built for SvelteKit","sveltekit-i18n/kit wires hooks, layouts and components: an instance per request on the server, so one visitor's language never reaches another visitor's page, and one per tab in the browser.",{"title":74,"text":75},"One install","The core and the Curly parser come with it. Nothing else to add, and only one reactive graph.",{"title":77,"text":78},"Loads what a route needs","A loader fires when both its locale and its route match, once per freshness window and route params.",{"title":80,"text":81},"One reactive instance","Svelte 5 runes instead of stores: properties you read, methods you await.",{"title":83,"text":84},"Typed keys and payloads","A schema slot narrows what t() and l() accept, down to each message's parameters. The @sveltekit-i18n/typegen Vite plugin fills it from your translations.",{"title":86,"text":87},"Extensible","The extensions pipe folds further surfaces onto the instance — Svelte stores, for one.",[89,91],{"id":90},"[\"en\",\"home\",[\"s:/\",\"s:/cs\",\"s:/de\"]]",{"id":92},"[\"cs\",\"home\",[\"s:/\",\"s:/cs\",\"s:/de\"]]","cs","/cs",true],"uses":{"route":1,"url":1}},{"type":"data","data":[{"install":1,"config":2,"use":3},"\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sveltekit-i18n\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># bun add sveltekit-i18n\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># deno add npm:sveltekit-i18n\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>","\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// src/lib/i18n.js\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineI18n } \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sveltekit-i18n/kit'\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u00